{{>layout/head-open}}

    <title>트리플에스 커뮤니티 - {{#isMarketBoard}}{{categoryName}}{{/isMarketBoard}}{{^isMarketBoard}}{{categoryName}} 게시판{{/isMarketBoard}}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{#asset}}/css/objekt-filter.css{{/asset}}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{#asset}}/css/article-page.css{{/asset}}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{#asset}}/css/member-portrait-picker.css{{/asset}}">
</head><body class="site-page article-page bg-surface text-on-surface min-h-screen flex flex-col">
{{>layout/header}}

<main class="flex-1 flex items-start justify-center px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 z-10 relative">
    <div class="w-full max-w-4xl relative">
        <!-- 배경 글로우 효과 -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-container/20 via-transparent to-secondary-container/30 blur-xl opacity-75 pointer-events-none"></div>

        <!-- 메인 컨테이너 카드 -->
        <div class="article-board-shell {{#hideRecommendations}}article-board-no-likes{{/hideRecommendations}} relative bg-surface-container/95 border border-outline-variant/50 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 backdrop-blur-2xl shadow-2xl">

            <!-- 상단 헤더 타이틀 -->
            <div class="article-board-title flex items-center justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-outline-variant/30">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#8decd9;flex-shrink:0"><path d="M20 11.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-8.5 8.5 9 9 0 0 1-4-.95L3 21l1.95-4.5A9 9 0 0 1 4 12.5 8.5 8.5 0 1 1 20 11.5Z"/><path d="M8 10h8M8 14h5"/></svg>
                    <h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight">
                        {{#isMarketBoard}}{{categoryName}}{{/isMarketBoard}}{{^isMarketBoard}}{{categoryName}} 게시판{{/isMarketBoard}}
                    </h1>
                </div>
            </div>

            {{#isMarketBoard}}
            <nav class="site-section-tabs market-tabs" aria-label="교환/거래 분류">
                <a class="site-section-tab" href="/trade?objektSide={{selectedObjektSide}}{{#hasSelectedMember}}&amp;member={{selectedMember}}{{/hasSelectedMember}}{{#hasSelectedSeason}}&amp;season={{selectedSeason}}{{/hasSelectedSeason}}{{#hasSelectedClass}}&amp;class={{selectedClass}}{{/hasSelectedClass}}{{#hasSearchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/hasSearchKeyword}}" {{#isTrade}}aria-current="page"{{/isTrade}}>교환</a>
                <a class="site-section-tab" href="/sell?objektSide={{selectedObjektSide}}{{#hasSelectedMember}}&amp;member={{selectedMember}}{{/hasSelectedMember}}{{#hasSelectedSeason}}&amp;season={{selectedSeason}}{{/hasSelectedSeason}}{{#hasSelectedClass}}&amp;class={{selectedClass}}{{/hasSelectedClass}}{{#hasSearchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/hasSearchKeyword}}" {{#isSell}}aria-current="page"{{/isSell}}>거래</a>
            </nav>
            <section class="market-member-filter" aria-label="트레이드 필터">
                {{#isObjektSideAll}}<p class="market-side-help" role="status">Have와 Want 양쪽에서 선택한 멤버를 검색합니다.</p>{{/isObjektSideAll}}
                <div class="market-filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="시즌·클래스·구분 필터">
                    <div class="objekt-filter relative{{#hasSelectedSeason}} is-filtered{{/hasSelectedSeason}}" id="market-season-dropdown">
                        <span class="objekt-filter-label">시즌</span>
                        <button type="button" id="market-season-toggle" class="objekt-filter-control" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="market-season-menu" aria-label="시즌">
                            <span id="market-season-label" class="truncate">{{#hasSelectedSeason}}{{selectedSeason}}{{/hasSelectedSeason}}{{^hasSelectedSeason}}전체{{/hasSelectedSeason}}</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined objekt-filter-caret" aria-hidden="true">arrow_drop_down</span>
                        </button>
                        <div id="market-season-menu" class="objekt-dropdown-menu hidden" data-season-options hidden>
                            <label class="objekt-choice">
                                <input type="checkbox" value="all" class="season-checkbox" {{^hasSelectedSeason}}checked{{/hasSelectedSeason}}>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-text">전체 시즌</span>
                            </label>
                            {{#marketSeasonOptions}}
                            <label class="objekt-choice">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="season" value="{{value}}" class="season-checkbox" {{#selected}}checked{{/selected}}>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-text">{{label}}</span>
                            </label>
                            {{/marketSeasonOptions}}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="objekt-filter relative{{#hasSelectedClass}} is-filtered{{/hasSelectedClass}}" id="market-class-dropdown">
                        <span class="objekt-filter-label">클래스</span>
                        <button type="button" id="market-class-toggle" class="objekt-filter-control" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="market-class-menu" aria-label="클래스">
                            <span id="market-class-label" class="truncate">{{#hasSelectedClass}}{{selectedClass}}{{/hasSelectedClass}}{{^hasSelectedClass}}전체{{/hasSelectedClass}}</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined objekt-filter-caret" aria-hidden="true">arrow_drop_down</span>
                        </button>
                        <div id="market-class-menu" class="objekt-dropdown-menu hidden" hidden>
                            <label class="objekt-choice">
                                <input type="checkbox" value="all" class="class-checkbox" {{^hasSelectedClass}}checked{{/hasSelectedClass}}>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-text">전체 클래스</span>
                            </label>
                            {{#marketClassOptions}}
                            <label class="objekt-choice">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="class" value="{{value}}" class="class-checkbox" {{#selected}}checked{{/selected}}>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                <span class="objekt-choice-text">{{label}}</span>
                            </label>
                            {{/marketClassOptions}}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {{#isTrade}}
                    <div class="objekt-filter market-side-filter" role="group" aria-label="멤버 검색 기준: Have 또는 Want">
                        <span class="objekt-filter-label">구분</span>
                        <div class="objekt-filter-control market-side-seg">
                            <a class="market-side-link{{#isObjektSideHave}} is-active{{/isObjektSideHave}}" href="{{boardBase}}?objektSide=have{{#selectedMember}}&amp;member={{selectedMember}}{{/selectedMember}}{{#selectedSeason}}&amp;season={{selectedSeason}}{{/selectedSeason}}{{#selectedClass}}&amp;class={{selectedClass}}{{/selectedClass}}{{#searchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/searchKeyword}}">Have</a>
                            <a class="market-side-link{{#isObjektSideWant}} is-active{{/isObjektSideWant}}" href="{{boardBase}}?objektSide=want{{#selectedMember}}&amp;member={{selectedMember}}{{/selectedMember}}{{#selectedSeason}}&amp;season={{selectedSeason}}{{/selectedSeason}}{{#selectedClass}}&amp;class={{selectedClass}}{{/selectedClass}}{{#searchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/searchKeyword}}">Want</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {{/isTrade}}
                    {{#isSell}}
                    <div class="objekt-filter market-side-filter" role="group" aria-label="판매 또는 구매">
                        <span class="objekt-filter-label">구분</span>
                        <div class="objekt-filter-control market-side-seg">
                            <a class="market-side-link{{#isObjektSideHave}} is-active{{/isObjektSideHave}}" href="{{boardBase}}?objektSide=have{{#selectedMember}}&amp;member={{selectedMember}}{{/selectedMember}}{{#selectedSeason}}&amp;season={{selectedSeason}}{{/selectedSeason}}{{#selectedClass}}&amp;class={{selectedClass}}{{/selectedClass}}{{#searchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/searchKeyword}}">판매</a>
                            <a class="market-side-link{{#isObjektSideWant}} is-active{{/isObjektSideWant}}" href="{{boardBase}}?objektSide=want{{#selectedMember}}&amp;member={{selectedMember}}{{/selectedMember}}{{#selectedSeason}}&amp;season={{selectedSeason}}{{/selectedSeason}}{{#selectedClass}}&amp;class={{selectedClass}}{{/selectedClass}}{{#searchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/searchKeyword}}">구매</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {{/isSell}}
                    {{#hasMarketAttrFilter}}
                    <a class="objekt-reset-button market-filter-reset" href="{{boardBase}}?objektSide={{selectedObjektSide}}{{#searchKeyword}}&amp;type={{#isSearchTitle}}title{{/isSearchTitle}}{{#isSearchContent}}content{{/isSearchContent}}{{#isSearchWriter}}writer{{/isSearchWriter}}&amp;keyword={{searchKeyword}}{{/searchKeyword}}">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 2.6 8.4M3 4v6h6"/></svg>
                        초기화
                    </a>
                    {{/hasMarketAttrFilter}}
                </div>
                <div class="market-member-picker{{#hasSelectedMember}} is-filtered{{/hasSelectedMember}}">
                    <div class="member-portrait-picker" id="market-member-picker" role="group" aria-label="멤버 선택">
                        {{>partials/member-portrait-picker}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="market-feed" aria-label="{{categoryName}} 피드">
                {{#articleList}}
                <article class="market-feed-card">
                    <header class="market-feed-card-head">
                        <div class="market-feed-card-meta">
                            {{#isTrade}}<span class="market-feed-badge is-wtt">WTT</span>{{/isTrade}}
                            {{#isSell}}
                            {{#hasWantPreview}}{{^hasHavePreview}}<span class="market-feed-badge is-wtb">구매</span>{{/hasHavePreview}}{{/hasWantPreview}}
                            {{#hasHavePreview}}{{^hasWantPreview}}<span class="market-feed-badge is-wts">판매</span>{{/hasWantPreview}}{{/hasHavePreview}}
                            {{#hasHavePreview}}{{#hasWantPreview}}<span class="market-feed-badge is-wtt">거래</span>{{/hasWantPreview}}{{/hasHavePreview}}
                            {{^hasObjektPreview}}<span class="market-feed-badge is-wts">거래</span>{{/hasObjektPreview}}
                            {{/isSell}}
                            <span class="market-feed-author">{{userId}}</span>
                            <time class="market-feed-time">{{formattedDate}}</time>
                        </div>
                        {{#hasMemberSwap}}
                        <p class="market-feed-members">
                            {{#hasHaveLead}}<span class="article-swap-name" style="--artist-color:{{haveLeadColor}}">{{haveLeadName}}</span>{{#hasHaveMore}} 외 {{haveMoreCount}}{{/hasHaveMore}}{{/hasHaveLead}}
                            {{#showTradeSwap}} <span class="market-feed-members-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{/showTradeSwap}}
                            {{#hasWantLead}}<span class="article-swap-name" style="--artist-color:{{wantLeadColor}}">{{wantLeadName}}</span>{{#hasWantMore}} 외 {{wantMoreCount}}{{/hasWantMore}}{{/hasWantLead}}
                        </p>
                        {{/hasMemberSwap}}
                    </header>
                    <a href="{{boardBase}}/{{id}}" class="market-feed-card-body" aria-label="{{title}}">
                        {{#hasObjektPreview}}
                        {{#isTrade}}
                        <div class="market-feed-deal">
                            <div class="market-feed-side" data-side="have">
                                <span class="market-feed-side-label">HAVE</span>
                                <div class="market-feed-strip">
                                    {{#hasHavePreview}}
                                    {{#havePreview}}
                                    <span class="market-feed-thumb{{^hasImage}} is-empty{{/hasImage}}" title="{{collectionNo}}">
                                        {{#hasImage}}<img src="{{thumbnailImage}}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{{/hasImage}}
                                        {{^hasImage}}<span>{{collectionNo}}</span>{{/hasImage}}
                                    </span>
                                    {{/havePreview}}
                                    {{#hasHavePreviewMore}}<span class="market-feed-more">+{{havePreviewMoreCount}}</span>{{/hasHavePreviewMore}}
                                    {{/hasHavePreview}}
                                    {{^hasHavePreview}}<span class="market-feed-side-empty">—</span>{{/hasHavePreview}}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="market-feed-swap" aria-hidden="true">⇌</span>
                            <div class="market-feed-side" data-side="want">
                                <span class="market-feed-side-label">WANT</span>
                                <div class="market-feed-strip">
                                    {{#hasWantPreview}}
                                    {{#wantPreview}}
                                    <span class="market-feed-thumb{{^hasImage}} is-empty{{/hasImage}}" title="{{collectionNo}}">
                                        {{#hasImage}}<img src="{{thumbnailImage}}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{{/hasImage}}
                                        {{^hasImage}}<span>{{collectionNo}}</span>{{/hasImage}}
                                    </span>
                                    {{/wantPreview}}
                                    {{#hasWantPreviewMore}}<span class="market-feed-more">+{{wantPreviewMoreCount}}</span>{{/hasWantPreviewMore}}
                                    {{/hasWantPreview}}
                                    {{^hasWantPreview}}<span class="market-feed-side-empty">—</span>{{/hasWantPreview}}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {{/isTrade}}
                        {{#isSell}}
                        <div class="market-feed-deal is-single">
                            {{#hasHavePreview}}
                            <div class="market-feed-side" data-side="have">
                                <span class="market-feed-side-label">HAVE</span>
                                <div class="market-feed-strip">
                                    {{#havePreview}}
                                    <span class="market-feed-thumb{{^hasImage}} is-empty{{/hasImage}}" title="{{collectionNo}}">
                                        {{#hasImage}}<img src="{{thumbnailImage}}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{{/hasImage}}
                                        {{^hasImage}}<span>{{collectionNo}}</span>{{/hasImage}}
                                    </span>
                                    {{/havePreview}}
                                    {{#hasHavePreviewMore}}<span class="market-feed-more">+{{havePreviewMoreCount}}</span>{{/hasHavePreviewMore}}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            {{/hasHavePreview}}
                            {{#hasWantPreview}}
                            {{^hasHavePreview}}
                            <div class="market-feed-side" data-side="want">
                                <span class="market-feed-side-label">WANT</span>
                                <div class="market-feed-strip">
                                    {{#wantPreview}}
                                    <span class="market-feed-thumb{{^hasImage}} is-empty{{/hasImage}}" title="{{collectionNo}}">
                                        {{#hasImage}}<img src="{{thumbnailImage}}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{{/hasImage}}
                                        {{^hasImage}}<span>{{collectionNo}}</span>{{/hasImage}}
                                    </span>
                                    {{/wantPreview}}
                                    {{#hasWantPreviewMore}}<span class="market-feed-more">+{{wantPreviewMoreCount}}</span>{{/hasWantPreviewMore}}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            {{/hasHavePreview}}
                            {{/hasWantPreview}}
                        </div>
                        {{/isSell}}
                        {{/hasObjektPreview}}
                        {{^hasObjektPreview}}
                        <p class="market-feed-note">{{title}}</p>
                        {{/hasObjektPreview}}
                    </a>
                </article>
                {{/articleList}}
                {{^articleList}}
                <div class="market-feed-empty">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-4xl mb-2" data-icon="inbox">inbox</span>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">
                        {{#hasMarketAttrFilter}}조건에 맞는 글이 없습니다.{{/hasMarketAttrFilter}}
                        {{^hasMarketAttrFilter}}{{#hasSearchKeyword}}검색 결과가 없습니다.{{/hasSearchKeyword}}{{^hasSearchKeyword}}아직 등록된 글이 없습니다.{{/hasSearchKeyword}}{{/hasMarketAttrFilter}}
                    </p>
                </div>
                {{/articleList}}
            </div>
            {{/isMarketBoard}}

            {{^isMarketBoard}}
            <!-- 게시판 테이블 영역 -->
            <div class="article-board-list w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-lowest/40 mb-8">

                <!-- 테이블 헤더 -->
                <div class="article-board-heading{{#hideRecommendations}} is-no-likes{{/hideRecommendations}} px-6 py-3.5 bg-surface-container-high/60 border-b border-outline-variant/40 text-on-surface-variant font-semibold text-sm text-center">
                    <div class="article-board-num">번호</div>
                    <div class="article-board-subject">제목</div>
                    <div class="article-board-author">작성자</div>
                    <div class="article-board-date">날짜</div>
                    {{^hideRecommendations}}<div class="article-board-likes">추천</div>{{/hideRecommendations}}
                </div>

                <!-- 테이블 바디 (게시글 목록 루프) -->
                <div class="divide-y divide-outline-variant/20">
                    {{#articleList}}
                        <div class="article-board-row{{#hideRecommendations}} is-no-likes{{/hideRecommendations}} px-6 py-4 items-center text-center text-sm text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-highest/30 transition-colors">
                            <div class="article-board-num text-outline font-mono">{{displayId}}</div>
                            <div class="article-board-subject text-left font-medium">
                                <a href="{{boardBase}}/{{id}}" class="article-board-subject-link hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">
                                    {{title}}
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="article-board-author text-on-surface-variant truncate">{{userId}}</div>
                            <div class="article-board-date text-xs text-outline">{{formattedDate}}</div>
                            {{^hideRecommendations}}<div class="article-board-likes text-primary-container font-semibold">{{likesCount}}</div>{{/hideRecommendations}}
                        </div>
                    {{/articleList}}

                    {{^articleList}}
                        <div class="py-16 text-center">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-4xl mb-2" data-icon="inbox">inbox</span>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">등록된 게시글이 없습니다.</p>
                        </div>
                    {{/articleList}}
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/isMarketBoard}}

            <!-- 하단 컨트롤: 일반 게시판은 검색+글쓰기, 교환/거래는 글쓰기만 -->
            <div class="article-board-controls flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-2">
                {{^isMarketBoard}}
                <form action="{{boardBase}}" method="get" class="article-board-search flex items-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto">
                    <label class="site-search-field article-board-search-type shrink-0">
                        <select name="type" aria-label="검색 유형">
                            <option value="title" {{#isSearchTitle}}selected{{/isSearchTitle}}>제목</option>
                            <option value="content" {{#isSearchContent}}selected{{/isSearchContent}}>내용</option>
                            <option value="writer" {{#isSearchWriter}}selected{{/isSearchWriter}}>작성자</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>
                    <div class="site-search-field article-board-search-keyword relative flex-1 sm:w-60">
                        <input type="search" name="keyword" value="{{searchKeyword}}" placeholder="검색어를 입력하세요" aria-label="게시글 검색어" autocomplete="off" />
                        <button type="submit" aria-label="게시글 검색" class="site-search-submit">
                            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
                {{/isMarketBoard}}

                <div class="flex items-center justify-end w-full sm:w-auto{{#isMarketBoard}} ml-auto{{/isMarketBoard}}">
                    {{#isAdmin}}
                            <a href="{{boardBase}}/new{{#isSell}}?objektSide={{selectedObjektSide}}{{/isSell}}" class="article-write-btn md-btn md-btn-filled py-2.5 px-5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-black font-headline-sm text-sm font-bold tracking-tight transition-all duration-200 btn-glow active:scale-[0.98] flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-black" data-icon="edit">edit</span>
                                <span class="text-black">{{#isTrade}}새 교환{{/isTrade}}{{#isSell}}새 거래{{/isSell}}{{^isMarketBoard}}글 쓰기{{/isMarketBoard}}</span>
                            </a>
                        {{/isAdmin}}

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<script src="{{#asset}}/js/objekt-dropdown-core.js{{/asset}}"></script>
<script src="{{#asset}}/js/member-portrait-picker.js{{/asset}}"></script>
<script src="{{#asset}}/js/article-market-board.js{{/asset}}"></script>
{{>layout/page-end}}

